<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3272] Memory consumption in ContinuousQueryHandler</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3272</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On backup nodes events put in queue with value and key. For filtered events need to store only update counter and partition. In attached test which should pass with -Xmx2g -Xms2g&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12976483">IGNITE-3272</key>
            <summary>Memory consumption in ContinuousQueryHandler</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
